nd":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-efc4edb8618056b2e20c","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-d6e88dadedcbc541c974","layer":"pei","quote":"至别去数日，忽驰思未尽其意，遂却骑驰还见亮。亮语福曰：‘孤知君还意。近日言语，虽弥日，有所不尽，更来（一）〔求〕决耳。君所问者，公琰其宜也。’福谢：‘前实失不咨请公：如公百年后，谁可任大事者；故辄还耳。乞复请，蒋琬之后，谁可任者？’亮曰：‘文伟可以继之。’又复问其次，亮不答","attribution":"裴注·益部耆旧杂记","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":344,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c6aee412dd18dafa1749","start":51,"end":188,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q2-47ed2e11e871785091f8","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-2c8eb2316ba7e3ae2458","layer":"original","quote":"先主定益州后，为书佐。西充国长，成都令。","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":324,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":11,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q2-d0f9f7815845743650b3","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-2c8eb2316ba7e3ae2458","layer":"original","quote":"为江州督、扬威将军。入为尚书仆射，封平阳亭侯。","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":324,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":42,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q2-f46c6578f33e567665bf","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-d6e88dadedcbc541c974","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《益部耆旧杂记》曰：“诸葛亮于武功病笃。后主遣福省侍，遂因咨以国家大计。福往具宣圣旨，听亮所言；至别去数日，忽驰思未尽其意，遂却骑驰还见亮。亮语福曰：‘孤知君还意。近日言语，虽弥日，有所不尽，更来（一）〔求〕决耳。君所问者，公琰其宜也。’福谢：‘前实失不咨请公：如公百年后，谁可任大事者；故辄还耳。乞复请，蒋琬之后，谁可任者？’亮曰：‘文伟可以继之。’又复问其次，亮不答。福还，奉使称旨。福为人精识果锐，敏于从政。子骧，字叔龙。亦有名，官至尚书郎、广汉太守。”","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文）","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":344,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c6aee412dd18dafa1749","start":0,"end":233,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-o040a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-8c21bf5035a1629efb0d","layer":"original","quote":"其年八月，亮疾病；卒于军，时年五十四。﹝四﹞及军退，宣王案行其营垒处所〖7〗，曰：“天下奇才也！”﹝五﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":52,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
